  tips:
  - '{target} sold a crate of our tools back to us. Came in from the north-east,
    where the ground drops toward the flats.'
  - Saw a cookfire out past the dunes, north-east, an hour's walk at most. {target}
    never could sit in the dark.
  - '{target} keeps two carriers to haul what gets lifted. Follow the cart ruts north-east
    and you''ll find the lot of them.'
